RevisionOS is a modular custom firmware distribution for the Apple iPod Classic
(6G, 6.5G, and 7G) based on Apple firmware 2.0.5.

Upstream projects and attribution:

- RevolaOS (https://github.com/RevolaOS): core firmware, hook site framework,
  extension loader, settings store, UI runtime, theme compiler, eApp SDK,
  QEMU emulator updates, and first-party extensions. GPL-3.0-only.
- RepriseOS (https://github.com/lgreitis/osos-lab,
  https://github.com/lgreitis/repriseos-installer): foundational 2.0.5 boot
  chain, reverse engineering, installer architecture, original game SDK, and
  Classic dark palette/artwork by lgreitis, Alex Ball (alexballvideos-netizen),
  RaduTek, Swimming33, brilliant-alien, and kayboll. GPL-3.0-only.
- PodBox (https://github.com/anthonyfletcher/podbox, commit
  7a89c33d0ed49c93ba49a8198e822b8adb72d0a5): iAP2 packet framing and HID
  reassembly reference used in Car Audio (iap2.rvx). GPL-2.0-or-later; the
  adapted Car Audio implementation is GPL-3.0-only.
- Rockbox (https://github.com/Rockbox/rockbox): bootloader, dual-boot
  installer, hardware drivers, USB helper, Crossfeed (Thom Johansen, Bertrik
  Sikken, Michael Sevakis), Channels (Thom Johansen, Michael Sevakis),
  Compressor (Jeffrey Goode), 2048 (Franklin Wei, Linus Nielsen Feltzing), and
  Dice (Brandon Low). GPL-2.0-or-later.
- wInd3x (https://github.com/freemyipod/wInd3x) by Serge "q3k" Bazanski:
  BootROM DFU exploit and tooling. GPL-2.0-or-later.
- giek2000 (https://github.com/giek2000/ipod-classic-firmware-research): iPod
  Classic firmware research.
- Cupertino Icons / Framework7 Icons (https://github.com/flutter/packages) by
  Vladimir Kharlampidi: Settings and Appearance menu glyphs. MIT License
  (see LICENSE.cupertino-icons).
- Khronos OpenGL ES 1.1 and KHR platform headers
  (https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenGL-Registry,
  https://github.com/KhronosGroup/EGL-Registry): bundled inside eApp binaries.
  MIT and Apache-2.0.
- Lima Sky and Mr. Goodliving Ltd.: original creators of Doodle Jump. The
  Doodle Jump package included here is an unofficial hobby port and is not
  affiliated with or endorsed by Lima Sky.

